-----------------------------------------------------------------------",
  "bug_report_content": "{\"id\":1033,\"status\":\"Fixed\",\"summary\":\"Generates code with invalid for/in left-hand assignment\",\"labels\":[\"Type-Defect\",\"Priority-Medium\"],\"stars\":0,\"commentCount\":4,\"comments\":[{\"id\":0,\"commenterId\":7153428347731157456,\"content\":\"\\u003cb\\u003eWhat steps will reproduce the problem?\\u003c/b\\u003e\\n1. Compile this:\\r\\n\\r\\nwindow.Foo \\u003d function(A, B, C, D) {\\r\\n  if ( A ) {                        \\r\\n    if ( B ) {\\r\\n      C \\u003d 0;\\r\\n    } else {\\r\\n      C \\u003d 0 in D;\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    while ( C-- ) {}\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cb\\u003eWhat is the expected output? What do you see instead?\\u003c/b\\u003e\\n\\r\\nExpected: Something that doesn\\u0027t have a syntax error, maybe\\r\\n\\r\\nwindow.Foo\\u003dfunction(b,c,a,d){if(b)for(a\\u003dc?0:(0 in d);a--;);};\\r\\n\\r\\nActual:\\r\\n\\r\\nwindow.Foo\\u003dfunction(b,c,a,d){if(b)for(a\\u003dc?0:0 in d;a--;);};\\r\\n\\r\\nSyntaxError: Unexpected token ; (Chrome)\\r\\ninvalid for/in left-hand side (Firefox)\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cb\\u003eWhat version of the product are you using? On what operating system?\\u003c/b\\u003e\\n\\r\\nhttp://closure-compiler.appspot.com/home\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cb\\u003ePlease provide any additional information below.\\u003c/b\\u003e\\n\\r\\nI noticed this while attempting to minify jquery\",\"timestamp\":1372426087,\"attachments\":[]},{\"id\":1,\"commenterId\":7153428347731157456,\"content\":\"I bisected, and it appears that the first bad commit is \\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://code.google.com/p/closure-compiler/source/detail?r\\u003d6842032b7c1857e0cdf690ce25a767b4365dd307\",\"timestamp\":1372427770,\"attachments\":[]},{\"id\":2,\"commenterId\":-8769171937076622550,\"content\":\"Thanks for the report!\\r\\n\\r\\nSounds like a code generation problem.\",\"timestamp\":1372438946,\"attachments\":[]},{\"id\":3,\"commenterId\":-8769171937076622550,\"content\":\"This issue was closed by revision 8d11b8cc7a61.\",\"timestamp\":1372460993,\"attachments\":[]}]}",
  "fix_diff": "--- com.google.javascript.jscomp.CodeGenerator (buggy)\n+++ com.google.javascript.jscomp.CodeGenerator (fixed)\n@@ -282,7 +282,7 @@\n       case Token.HOOK: {\n         Preconditions.checkState(childCount == 3);\n         int p = NodeUtil.precedence(type);\n-        Context rhsContext = Context.OTHER;\n+        Context rhsContext = getContextForNoInOperator(context);\n         addExpr(first, p + 1, context);\n         cc.addOp(\"?\", true);\n         addExpr(first.getNext(), 1, rhsContext);"
